  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)<br>\n<strong>Enhances:</strong> Popup Grenade Launcher (Corgo's Projectile Launch System)<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p>Enhances a Projectile Launch System, raising its capacity by 4 to 5 grenades or rockets, but reloading it takes one extra Action. While Combat Software (Launch Capacity Override) is installed, the user can spend an Action to charge it; their next Action has to be a ROF 1 attack using it or the charge is lost. Using it spends 5 rounds of loaded ammunition as a single explosive attack over a 14x14m/yds area (7x7 squares), dealing the damage that ammunition normally would but re-rolled for each target. Dodging it is done at -2.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The +4 capacity is applied automatically.</li>\n<li>Cyberpunk RED - Core 0.92.4 ships no Projectile Launch System item; its Popup Grenade Launcher is the same thing under another name, so install this into that.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Cyberarms).</em></p>"
